                                "sense_id": "562507bf-e458-3f73-b9e7-df762cd3bece",
                                "text": "Moreover, the CDI concept rationalizes the application structure by making the wiring points of one class with others explicit."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e11b582-5c65-3425-8795-23ded0cf25ea",
                        "entry_id": "43d7dc4d-2e00-3ba6-a5ba-0a0a93ae62b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of Clostridioides difficile infection."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f577d75-8307-473a-a2c2-de9a911ecd08",
                                "sense_id": "6e11b582-5c65-3425-8795-23ded0cf25ea",
                                "text": "[…] CDI should be placed on preemptive contact precautions pending the Clostridioides difficile test results. Patients with CDI should be admitted to a private room with a dedicated toilet to decrease transmission to other patients."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f0bee65-976e-4f6a-ba12-19694d1b1fbc",
                                "sense_id": "6e11b582-5c65-3425-8795-23ded0cf25ea",
                                "text": "The highest incidence of Clostridioides difficile infection (CDI) among hospitalized patients is reported in the Northeast and during spring months; highest CDI mortality rates are reported in the Midwest and during winter (2001 to 2010)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "200e6cf0-4a57-356f-8a86-b83f820000fc",
                        "entry_id": "43d7dc4d-2e00-3ba6-a5ba-0a0a93ae62b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ellipsis of CDI factor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "abbreviation",
